   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Investment Fund Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objectives are: (i) improved living conditions of poor communities and vulnerable groups in target areas; (ii) empowered communities and vulnerable groups in targeted areas to address local social needs; and  (iii) assistance to reform of social protection by creating models of targeting and service provision.</narrative>
  </description>
